<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Automatic Move Cursor To Shield Cordinates</Major>
    <Description>This macro allows you to automatically equip a shield; simply change the appropriate coordinates on your monitor.

-If you are playing at a resolution of 1440x1080, you don't need to make any changes.

 Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR 122 26
MoveTo 1016 575
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rise Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>